        "original_id": "b0c89e04-0b6a-5605-bf42-36722f291431",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robbie Tucker, Max Ehrich\n- TV Series: Criminal Minds, FlashForward, It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia\n- Fictional Characters: Fenmore Baldwin, The Gang\n- Places: South Philadelphia, Paddy's Pub\n\nFacts:\n- Robbie Tucker was born on April 5, 2001, and he is an American actor.\n- Robbie Tucker appeared on the television series Criminal Minds, FlashForward, and It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia.\n- It's Always Sunny in Philadelphia follows The Gang, a group of debauched and self-centered friends who run the Irish bar Paddy's Pub in South Philadelphia.\n- Fenmore Baldwin was initially portrayed by various child actors including Robbie Tucker.\n- In 2012, Fenmore Baldwin was rapidly aged to a teenager, and Max Ehrich assumed the role.",
